BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Early Bird Museum Highlight Tour at Newport Car Museum
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260401
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260402
DTSTAMP:20261112T183421Z
UID:75253880a8c565d95c2d97a759c9@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Early Bird Highlight Tour For 90 minutes (8:30 &#8211\; 10:00 
 AM) prior to Museum opening. Call to book: +1 (401) 848-2277 Price $75.00 
 per person (minimum 2\, maximum 6 ppl) Offered Wednesday\, Thursday\, and 
 Saturday only April 1 - December 31\, 2026. General admission is included 
 with price. 72-hour advance notice is suggested. Only one group will be ho
 sted on any given morning. This is your chance to have the Newport Car Mus
 eum all to yourself with a private guide to share with you the not-to-miss
  highlights in seven expansive galleries. With over 100 iconic\, rare and 
 exotic cars on display at one time\, this private collection is bursting w
 ith history\, provenance and color\, not to mention the breathtaking sculp
 tural beauty of automotive designs starting with the 1950s and finishing w
 ith new models from the 21 st Century. After 90 minutes with your private
 \, continue to explore at your own pace so that you can further examine yo
 ur favorites from the Ford/Shelby\, Corvette\, World Car\, Porsche\, Fin C
 ar\, American Muscle and Mopar exhibits while enjoying immersive videos\, 
 artwork and the Museum’s eclectic collection of Mid-Century Modern Furni
 ture. Operating hours can also vary based on weather conditions. Call for 
 more details.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/early-bird
 -museum-highlight-tour-at-newport-car-museum/109638/
LOCATION:Newport Car Museum\, Enter at Light 1947 West Main Road\, Portsmo
 uth\, RI 02871
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/early-bird-museum-highlight-tou
 r-at-newport-car-museum/109638/
END:VEVENT
