BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:90's vs Y2K New Years Eve
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTSTAMP:20261112T183421Z
UID:694dfca63be94a82aaca11945085@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to step into a time warp this New Year's Eve at Ball
 y's 90s vs. Y2K Party! As you walk through the doors\, you're instantly tr
 ansported back to the iconic decade\, where glitter and neon rule the nigh
 t. A room shimmers with sequins and metallic streamers\, setting the scene
  for a night that's equal parts nostalgia and pure 90s magic. Everywhere y
 ou look\, people are decked out in throwback fashion-baggy low-rise jeans
 \, crop tops\, chokers\, oversized blazers\, and bucket hats-transforming 
 the venue into a vibrant flashback of pop culture's greatest era. Feel the
  familiar beat hit as a live DJ spins a playlist packed with the unforgett
 able anthems of the 90s. The air comes alive with Britney's iconic hooks\,
  Mariah's soaring notes\, and the harmonies of Boyz II Men\, each song dra
 wing you deeper into the moment. Enjoy a musical performance by the Felix 
 Brown Band. Be amazed by a show by Mentalist David Hall and magician Peter
  Boie and laugh amongst your friends and family as you are in awe of their
  mentalist/ magic show. Get ready for the largest 90's dance party in Rhod
 e Island\, filled with all of these hits! As the midnight countdown approa
 ches\, the room dims\, anticipation buzzing through the crowd. Giant scree
 ns light up with retro graphics\, flashing 90s-inspired designs\, and ever
 yone joins in\, counting down in unison\, caught between past and future. 
 When the clock strikes twelve\, the lights dazzle\, and everyone raises th
 eir glasses to both the magic of the 90s and the promise of a brand new ye
 ar. This New Year's Eve\, you're not just celebrating-you're time-travelin
 g back to an unforgettable era filled with nostalgia and excitement. Don't
  just watch the ball drop\; come relive the ultimate 90s experience and st
 art the new year with a blast from the past!Get tickets now before prices 
 rise! URL: Tickets: https://go.evvnt.com/3619726-0?pid=10404 Date and Time
 : Thursday\, 31 December 2026 at 19:00 - Friday\, 01 January 2027 at 02:00
  Venue details: Bally's Lincoln\, 100 Twin River Rd\, Lincoln\, Rhode Isla
 nd\, 02865\, United States Category: Community | Local / Community Price: 
 General Admission: USD 52.00\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/e
 vent/90s-vs-y2k-new-years-eve/110031/
LOCATION:Bally's Lincoln\, 100 Twin River Rd\, Lincoln\, 02865
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/90s-vs-y2k-new-years-eve/110031
 /
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Community Recipe Book Night
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTSTAMP:20261112T183421Z
UID:57e173b61d9e8b4491a8707ab16e@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a cozy community gathering that centers the foods\, cult
 ures\, and memories that shaped us. You can add: A family recipe or dish c
 onnected to your culture or childhood The story or memory behind a dish Ph
 otos\, drawings\, or other personal touches if you’re comfortable Pages 
 will be scanned into a “Recipes That Raised Us” cookbook and a copy wi
 ll be emailed to all participants. All craft supplies such as recipe templ
 ates\, pens/markers\, stickers\, scrapbook paper\, glue\, scissors\, magaz
 ines\, and other decorative elements will be provided. Pricing: RSVP via E
 ventbrite is strongly encouraged. *Pay what/if you can\, with a suggested 
 donation of $5-$10* Community Note: All Delightful Intention events are de
 signed for women\, LGBTQ+\, and BIPOC folks to gather\, meet new people\, 
 and build connections in a way that feels intentional and low-pressure. Al
 l respectful community members are welcome. Contact Information: Email del
 ightfulintentions333@gmail.com\, or reach out to @Delightful.Intentions_ o
 n Instagram\, or @Trippinonmhina on TikTok with any questions!\n\nSource: 
 https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/community-recipe-book-night/112500/
LOCATION:Public Shop & Gallery\, 50 Agnes Street\, Providence\, 02909 Time
 : 6:30 PM to 8:30 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/community-recipe-book-night/112
 500/
END:VEVENT
