DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTSTAMP:20261112T183421Z
UID:3f99d777a292bc6361737d6c984c@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to groove as the legendary Dark Star Orchestra takes
  the stage at the Providence Performing Arts Center for an unforgettable n
 ight of music! This iconic band is renowned for their electrifying perform
 ances that pay homage to the Grateful Dead\, blending nostalgia with a fre
 sh twist. The beautiful ambiance of the Providence Performing Arts Center
 \, with its stunning architecture and intimate setting\, creates the perfe
 ct backdrop for an evening filled with soulful melodies and vibrant energy
 . Join fellow music lovers in Providence for the Dark Star Orchestra - Pro
 vidence concert\, where you can relive classic hits and experience the mag
 ic of live rock music. Whether you’re a longtime fan or new to their sou
 nd\, this is a night you won’t want to miss. Grab your friends\, let the
  music take you away\, and secure your tickets today for an experience tha
 t promises to resonate long after the final note!\n\nSource: https://www.v
 isitrhodeisland.com/event/dark-star-orchestra-providence/111372/
LOCATION:Providence Performing Arts Center\, 220 Weybosset Street\, Provid
 ence\, RI 02903 Time: 7:30 PM 220 Weybosset Street\, Providence\, RI 02903
