BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Intentional Celebration: Holiday Edition
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261206
DTSTAMP:20261112T183421Z
UID:6f484250684bf2271dde2a31e276@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The Intentional Celebration: Holiday Edition is a two-day indo
 or holiday market and immersive Christmas experience taking place December
  5&#8211\;6\, 2026\, at the WaterFire Arts Center in Providence\, Rhode Is
 land. Free admission from 12&#8211\;5pm both days\, with a paid VIP Hour f
 rom 11am&#8211\;12pm. Beyond traditional holiday shopping\, guests can ste
 p inside festive installations\, join hands-on workshops\, and watch live 
 demonstrations covering holiday decorating\, tablescapes\, floral design\,
  entertaining\, and celebration planning. Instead of simply admiring a dec
 orated tree or a beautifully set table\, attendees can meet the designers 
 and makers behind them and learn how to recreate the ideas at home. The we
 ekend also brings a curated marketplace of local makers and small business
 es\, food trucks\, holiday music\, creative stations for kids\, and a visi
 t from Santa — making it a full day out for families as well as hosts\, 
 DIYers\, and anyone planning their own seasonal gatherings. Shop\, create
 \, learn\, and celebrate the season all in one place. Free admission · Pa
 id VIP Hour tickets on sale now at https://planfuleventkits.com/events Wat
 erFire Arts Center · Providence\, Rhode Island · Free off-street parking
  available\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/the-intention
 al-celebration%3a-holiday-edition/111943/
LOCATION:WaterFire Arts Center\, 475 Valley Street Providence\, RI 02908\,
  Providence\, 02908
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/the-intentional-celebration%3a-
 holiday-edition/111943/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bosgraaf Stained Glass Studio’s 11th Annual Holiday Sale & Hot C
 hocolate Happening!
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261206
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261207
DTSTAMP:20261112T183421Z
UID:be38fc7a5f892549ae1dbf46140c@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:All are invited to Bosgraaf Stained Glass Studio’s 11th Annu
 al Holiday Sale\, featuring original glass works from over 60 student arti
 sts and a 6-foot artist-painted Nutcracker named Sir Fluxalot. This very s
 pecial event that takes place over two days and a portion of proceeds bene
 fit the Johnnycake Youth Center in Peace Dale. Saturday\, Dec 5\, 2026 fro
 m 10:00am &#8211\; 4:00pm &amp\; Sunday\, Dec 6\, 2026 from 10:00am &#8211
 \; 3:00pm Art glass pieces abound with locally-inspired designs\, and holi
 day\, nature\, whimsical\, and enchanting pieces for every price range. Th
 e public will get to view and choose from hundreds of unique creative stai
 ned glass and fused glass pieces that are functional and decorative. Handc
 rafted holiday ornaments will abound as always — this is the perfect sto
 p for hostess gifts and holiday decor! Credit cards accepted. All ages are
  welcome. Everyone who attends receives a complimentary hot chocolate and 
 raffle prize entry. Gooseneck Vineyards is hosting a wine tasting on site
 \, Saturday December 5th from 1:00pm-3:00pm. Location: 1214 Kingstown Road
  Peace Dale\, RI 02879 Event contact: Peggy Corcoran bosgraafstudio@gmail.
 com Facebook Event: https://www.facebook.com/share/1GvYWUxEQS Website: htt
 ps://www.bosgraafstudio.com/11th-annual-art-sale-hot-chocolate-happening\n
 \nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/bosgraaf-stained-glass-st
 udio%e2%80%99s-11th-annual-holiday-sale-%26-hot-chocolate-happening!/11248
 6/
